* Gates on Aztec
** Cost model
*** Gate = proving work on the user's device
*** Circuit sized for its worst case
*** Kernel: ~290k fixed, ~101k per extra private call
*** Delivery ~20k, tree read 3.5k, delayed read 4k, note slot 3k
*** aztec profile gates / flamegraph / aztec-wallet profile
** Seven measured cases
*** Duplicate read: -1,920 (half the quoted price)
*** Hoist invariant reads: -5,748 per batch
*** Note budget 2 + only_self recursion: -42,203
*** Constrained delivery: +20-24k each, sets batch caps
*** Screening reads: the cost of a feature, paid once
*** Packing: slots, not always gates
*** Library vs internal: byte-identical; constant asserts free
** Lessons
*** Measure; estimates miss both ways
*** Unused budget is paid budget
*** Side effects cost more than computation
*** Trade-offs belong to the user
*** Tests and profile together
@endmindmap
